#: ddf5573b363a4b21b5d15eaa3985aea0
msgid "`EXmaps.com <https://www.exmaps.com/>`__ - online flight logbook made for the ArduPilot system. Just drag and drop log files for post flight analysis and cumulative flight time"
msgstr ""

